 "problems": [
  "No infobox of the four states (or of County of Cerdanya, Roussillon) gives an area, so no area ratio could be computed.",
  "Cliopatria's Wikipedia field for County of Barcelona is 'Girona' and for County of Berga is the town 'Berga'; the authors used County of Barcelona and County of Cerdanya instead.",
  "county-of-osona (another eu-12 part) overlaps three batch dossiers: its Cliopatria polygons 990-1110 include the Garrotxa (Besalú), its 798-989 keyframes add the Berguedà (Berga from 897), and it holds the Vic plain which Barcelona draws 886-1162. Needs one decision across the four owners.",
  "The reviewer brief's mirror rule (a vassal_start in the vassal's ledger) conflicts with the schema (vassal events are written by the suzerain, counterpart = the vassal); Berga's 957/988 vassal events over Besalú were accepted without a mirror.",
  "Reviewer applied fixes in place to county-of-barcelona and kingdom-of-galicia (both re-validated, 0 errors, 0 warnings)."
